FunctionFS v2 serialized descriptor bytes, rendered as hexadecimal because this
evidence writer preserves text files only:
03 00 00 00 52 00 00 00 0f 00 00 00 02 00 00 00
02 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
09 04 00 00 01 ff ff 00 01 07 05 01 02 00 00 01
09 04 00 00 01 ff ff 00 01 07 05 01 02 00 02 01
09 04 00 00 01 ff ff 00 01 07 05 01 02 00 04 01
06 30 00 00 00 00

The bytes above are the original defective serialization: FS=0, HS=512,
SS=1024. The corrected blob differs only in the FS endpoint packet-size bytes,
which become 40 00 (64 little-endian).
